  ($pp$Sonoma Coast State Park$pp$, $pp$sonoma-coast-state-park$pp$, $pp$beach$pp$::public.place_type, $pp$California State Parks$pp$, 38.4244, -123.0883, $pp$north_bay$pp$::public.region, $pp$Bodega Bay$pp$, $pp$leash_required$pp$::public.dog_status, $pp$Dogs are allowed on leash on specified beaches only: Marshall Gulch, Carmet, Schoolhouse, Portuguese, Duncan's Cove, Wright's, Furlong Gulch, Shell, Blind and Russian Gulch beaches, and in the Bodega Dunes campground. Dogs are NOT allowed on Goat Rock Beach, on the Salmon Creek beaches, or on the Bodega Dunes beach and dunes trails. No dogs at the Pomo Canyon or Willow Creek environmental camps.$pp$, null, $pp$https://www.parks.ca.gov/?page_id=451$pp$, $pp$verified$pp$::public.verification_status, $pp$2026-11-15$pp$::date, $pp$claude (official page fetch), pending human review$pp$, null, 90, $pp$editorial$pp$, '{}'::text[], null, null, null, null, $pp$2026-11-15T00:00:00.000Z$pp$::timestamptz, $pp$2026-11-15T00:00:00.000Z$pp$::timestamptz),
  ($pp$Fort Ross State Historic Park$pp$, $pp$fort-ross-state-historic-park$pp$, $pp$park$pp$::public.place_type, $pp$California State Parks$pp$, 38.5162, -123.2428, $pp$north_bay$pp$::public.region, $pp$Jenner$pp$, $pp$leash_required$pp$::public.dog_status, $pp$The state's dog page lists dogs as allowed on leash and gives no extra limits for this park. Statewide, dogs are generally not allowed on trails or in undeveloped areas unless a park allows them, so follow posted signs. Statewide rules: dogs must be on a leash of 6 feet or less and under your control, and may not be left unattended.$pp$, null, $pp$https://www.parks.ca.gov/Dogs$pp$, $pp$verified$pp$::public.verification_status, $pp$2026-11-15$pp$::date, $pp$claude (official page fetch), pending human review$pp$, $pp$The state's dog page gives no park-specific detail for Fort Ross, so which areas allow dogs is unconfirmed.$pp$, 90, $pp$editorial$pp$, '{}'::text[], null, null, null, null, $pp$2026-11-15T00:00:00.000Z$pp$::timestamptz, $pp$2026-11-15T00:00:00.000Z$pp$::timestamptz),
