  ($pp$Wildcat Canyon Regional Park$pp$, $pp$wildcat-canyon-regional-park$pp$, $pp$trail$pp$::public.place_type, $pp$East Bay Regional Park District$pp$, 37.9515, -122.3224, $pp$east_bay_north$pp$::public.region, $pp$Richmond$pp$, $pp$off_leash_zones$pp$::public.dog_status, $pp$Dogs must be on leash at all times on Nimitz Way, in all parking and staging areas and in all developed areas. Dogs may be off leash in open space areas if under voice control. Dogs are not permitted in the Tilden Nature Area. Walking more than three dogs at a time needs a dog-walking permit.$pp$, $pp$Off-leash only in open space areas, under voice control. Leash required on Nimitz Way and in developed areas.$pp$, $pp$https://www.ebparks.org/parks/wildcat-canyon$pp$, $pp$verified$pp$::public.verification_status, $pp$2026-11-16$pp$::date, $pp$claude (official page fetch), pending human review$pp$, null, 90, $pp$editorial$pp$, '{}'::text[], null, null, null, null, $pp$2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z$pp$::timestamptz, $pp$2026-11-16T00:00:00.000Z$pp$::timestamptz),
